    m_Alignment: 7
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.25
  m_Text: 'Ice attribute may trigger freezing effect and cause numerical damage;

    Fire
    attribute may trigger ignition effect and cause proportional damage;

    Thunder
    attribute may trigger stun effect, but will not cause additional damage.

    All
    the above attributes will be eliminated after a period of time.

    Poison attribute
    may trigger poisoning and continue to cause proportional damage. But bosses can
    often alleviate or even remove poisoning.'
